      "pr_number": 26395,
      "sha": "5a06879d94422fd04dd9173300445491f12f9d1f",
      "base_sha": "",
      "subject": "Fix window filter pushdown for decreasing partition expressions",
      "body": " This fixes a correctness regression introduced by 7bcaeeb2da(#26107, \"Window Monotonic Pushdown\").\r\n\r\nWindow filter pushdown can return incorrect results for decreasing partition expressions. For example, `PARTITION BY -x` with an outer `WHERE x > 1` generates the invalid auxiliary filter `-x > -1`, dropping matching rows.\r\n\r\nRestrict auxiliary filter generation to increasing functions. Simply  reversing the inequality is insufficient for floating-point NaN values.",
      "parent_count": 1,
      "expected": "accept",
      "human_reason": "исправление window pushdown, правка src/ и test/optimizer",
